<title>USA: B&amp;H Maritime approves asset sale.</title>
<headline>B&amp;H Maritime approves asset sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>B&amp;H Ocean Carriers Ltd said on Thursday that B&amp;H Maritime Carriers Ltd shareholders approved the previously announced sale of its assets.</p>
<p>B&amp;H Ocean Carriers, which owns 65 percent of B&amp;H Marine, will issue 495,950 shares of its common stock to other B&amp;H Marine shareholders, the company said.</p>
<p>After the issuance of shares, B&amp;H Ocean Carriers will have 4,314,025 shares outstanding.  B&amp;H Ocean will get three product tankers and assume all of B&amp;H Marine's liabilities, it said.</p>
</text>
